port devel/sope
type port
reason "auto-converted from compat (Makefile.DragonFly + dragonfly/)"
target @any

# clang19 errors on EOEntity.m's comparator; FreeBSD's Makefile turns
# that off for OPSYS FreeBSD only.
text replace-once file Makefile from ".if ${OPSYS} == FreeBSD" to ".if ${OPSYS} == FreeBSD || ${OPSYS} == DragonFly"
